    {
      "id": "puzzles",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## Puzzles\n\n- **The flooded fifth floor.** Otto works in water — the rehearsal for the descent into the heart. [[Clause 10 — Standing Water]] is in permanent breach here.\n- [[Anna's Flat]], in single-point perspective. 🔧",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "mazepocket",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## Maze / pocket\n\nNone.",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "cutscenes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 268,
      "text": "## Cutscenes\n\n- Cold open: the envelope marked \"A.\" is opened.\n- **The evening call.** Opens with the same sentence as the 3 AM call on D1, then she says something only a living person would say, in the future tense, and Otto does not correct her. Cut with flashbacks.\n- **Chapter ending — the rubbing of the eyes.** The player is put on the beach in 1998: the wind, the sand, the hands going to the eyes, the empty water.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "npcdialogue",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 328,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## NPC dialogue\n\n🔧"
    },
