      "id": "keyitem",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## Key item\n\n**Her love** — the photograph, developed from her own undeveloped roll on her father's rig. The only photograph among the eight.",
      "color": "2"
